OL,3,GNEWSA'It doesn't matter what I do - I
OL,4,Astill can't get a job'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm not gonna lie to you, it's really
OL,7,Fhard. It doesn't matter what I do, I
OL,8,Fstill somehow don't get the job."
OL,10,FGhaniyyah Sulieman is 18 and struggling
OL,11,Fto find work in Leeds.
OL,13,F"I've been looking online. I've applied
OL,14,Ffor hundreds of jobs online, and then I
OL,15,Fdecided to go in person as well."
OL,17,FThe number of young people not in
OL,18,Feducation, employment or training
OL,19,F(Neets) has been thrust back into the
OL,20,Fspotlight this week with the release of
OL,21,FAlan Milburn's much-awaited report on
OL,22,Fthis cohort.
